------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- Method:      pickAccessWWayReturn
--
-- Description: repositions access point
--
-- Method Type: Procedure
-- Arguments:
--   [#] [R/RW] [Data Type] [Description]
--    1   R      EDGPOSITIONDATA
--                           edg pick data
-- Return:
